        "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) faithfully reproduces Mus musculus / Drosophila melanogaster epithelial monolayers morphology" ;
