    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus / Drosophila melanogaster epithelial monolayers specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-epithelial-buckling-3d-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
